  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rugby League in the Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australian and Pacific governments have recognised the enormous potential of sport to contribute to national development and bilateral outcomes. Sport has demonstrated its ability to connect people while addressing development challenges including healthier lives, access to education, inclusion and gender equality. This places Australia as the partner of choice to provide the expertise the Pacific needs to realise their ambitions to further develop rugby league in the region, through design and delivery of programming to achieve the development objectives of the ARLC&apos;s Pacific Rugby League Strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
